WEBVTT

00:06.470 --> 00:07.750
Shit...

00:10.380 --> 00:14.430
Good thing I asked for a protective charm.

00:14.990 --> 00:15.900
Well.

00:17.170 --> 00:19.590
I thought I found a perfect corpse.

00:21.030 --> 00:22.790
But you're still alive.

02:00.270 --> 02:01.400
Are you up?

02:03.940 --> 02:05.450
Don't move.

02:07.630 --> 02:11.800
And why are you up already?

02:14.550 --> 02:17.750
I see you've learned to fix people's hair.

02:17.750 --> 02:19.780
It's so that you'll leave sooner.

02:20.710 --> 02:21.740
Ow!

02:21.740 --> 02:23.500
Be more gentle.

02:25.930 --> 02:27.040
Lucy.

02:27.040 --> 02:27.950
Chise?

02:29.280 --> 02:30.880
Wait, isn't that...

02:32.790 --> 02:34.640
I asked for it.

02:35.110 --> 02:36.580
Never mind that, Lucy.

02:36.580 --> 02:40.270
You haven't been looking at your 
bank documents at all, have you?

02:41.510 --> 02:44.010
I told you, I'm not using your money!

02:44.010 --> 02:46.100
At least check on it.

02:52.010 --> 02:54.370
A-A million pounds?!

02:54.680 --> 02:56.420
What is this money?!

02:56.420 --> 02:59.330
You didn't get involved in some kind 
of criminal business, did you?!

03:00.270 --> 03:05.170
I think what I did would be considered 
quite humane in the sorcerer world.

03:10.360 --> 03:13.350
Speaking of which, are you two acquainted?

03:13.350 --> 03:14.640
Well...

03:14.640 --> 03:17.400
Seth-san saved me.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.490
How?

03:18.490 --> 03:19.560
That's...

03:20.410 --> 03:21.460
A secret.

03:21.460 --> 03:26.240
I've had it with this habit of yours where you 
stop right before you're about to say something!

03:26.240 --> 03:28.000
I'll mess you up!

03:33.800 --> 03:35.320
Leave, already.

03:35.320 --> 03:36.510
I'll send you off.

03:36.510 --> 03:37.930
I'm getting changed.

03:41.810 --> 03:45.210
She's really your sister?

03:45.880 --> 03:48.210
I've been taking care of her 
in place of our parents.

03:48.920 --> 03:52.120
I might be more of a father 
than a brother now.

03:55.340 --> 04:02.550
Yesod, Hod, Netzach, Tiferet, 
Chokhmah, Keter...

04:03.620 --> 04:05.180
Transferring.

04:22.080 --> 04:23.960
Looks like you're awake.

04:24.400 --> 04:25.570
Can you breathe?

04:26.100 --> 04:27.320
Barely.

04:28.320 --> 04:29.450
Where am I?

04:30.200 --> 04:31.460
The nurse's office?

04:31.460 --> 04:32.260
Yes.

04:32.260 --> 04:33.460
The other one.

04:34.040 --> 04:38.710
You would have been in trouble if Ainsworth 
hadn't shared his magic power.

04:38.710 --> 04:39.650
Magic power?!

04:39.650 --> 04:40.640
Stay still.

04:41.140 --> 04:43.220
I'm going to hook up the IV.

04:43.220 --> 04:44.380
Remain as you are.

04:48.840 --> 04:50.060
What happened?

04:50.540 --> 04:54.070
You were lying on the ground 
by the trees in the yard.

04:54.070 --> 04:56.230
I happened to pass by.

04:56.230 --> 04:57.450
The yard?

04:57.450 --> 04:59.540
I don't remember going out...

05:04.260 --> 05:05.780
Was someone there?

05:05.780 --> 05:06.850
No...

05:06.850 --> 05:08.520
I can't remember.

05:10.370 --> 05:14.460
You shared your magic power with me, huh?

05:14.460 --> 05:16.710
Thanks. I know it's precious.

05:17.270 --> 05:20.470
I don't share it often, but it's 
not that precious, either.

05:20.470 --> 05:21.750
Yeah?

05:22.400 --> 05:25.500
Thanks, Mr. Ainsworth.

05:31.460 --> 05:36.300
Tory suggested I become friends with you.

05:36.850 --> 05:38.770
What does he mean?

05:52.590 --> 05:55.050
Are you really sure you 
don't need more sleep?

05:55.050 --> 05:58.740
I said it's fine, so it is.

05:59.030 --> 06:00.980
See? She's stubborn.

06:09.060 --> 06:09.950
Oh?

06:09.950 --> 06:11.270
He's not here.

06:11.270 --> 06:12.720
Your guard?

06:18.310 --> 06:21.250
Finally, the two of you are here.

06:26.720 --> 06:27.730
Brother!

06:30.950 --> 06:33.160
A protective charm.

06:33.160 --> 06:36.050
What do you mean, the two of us?

06:36.050 --> 06:38.530
It seems you have business 
with the Websters.

06:43.170 --> 06:44.200
You!

06:48.000 --> 06:50.500
Stand down, mage.

06:50.500 --> 06:52.760
This doesn't involve you.

06:52.760 --> 06:54.090
I can't do that.

06:54.090 --> 06:55.150
Chise-san!

06:55.150 --> 06:57.180
Take my sister and run!

06:57.180 --> 06:58.610
I can't let anything happen to you.

07:03.870 --> 07:04.770
Ruth!

07:24.220 --> 07:26.880
Seth-san, Lucy, to the library.

07:29.460 --> 07:30.740
Please, Ruth!

07:38.270 --> 07:40.150
Seth-san, who are they?

07:40.150 --> 07:42.260
I'm sorry we've gotten you involved.

07:42.560 --> 07:45.780
I'd hoped they would have given up by now.

07:48.020 --> 07:49.540
<i>Those bastards...</i>

07:53.660 --> 07:54.900
Elias!

07:55.410 --> 07:56.590
The shadow...

07:57.450 --> 07:59.270
Chise, are you hurt?

07:59.270 --> 08:00.450
Just a little.

08:01.870 --> 08:02.930
I see.

08:18.420 --> 08:19.430
Brother!

08:27.400 --> 08:29.200
<i>I can't use my sorcery!</i>

08:34.100 --> 08:35.020
Lucy!

08:35.370 --> 08:36.660
Are you okay?

08:37.310 --> 08:38.890
Assholes...

08:39.800 --> 08:41.610
It was you, wasn't it?

08:41.610 --> 08:43.500
You killed my family!

08:52.290 --> 08:54.800
We failed to finish the job.

08:54.800 --> 08:57.870
We finish it today.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.680
<i>We need to escape somewhere.</i>

09:02.250 --> 09:06.220
You know where you need to go, don't you?

09:17.370 --> 09:18.390
Chise.

09:26.260 --> 09:27.260
Hey!

09:27.260 --> 09:28.320
Where are we...

09:28.660 --> 09:30.380
I'll explain later.

09:30.380 --> 09:31.370
Close your eyes.

09:31.370 --> 09:32.680
Don't say anything.

09:33.190 --> 09:34.590
No matter what.

09:39.440 --> 09:40.790
I see.

09:42.500 --> 09:43.630
Go.

09:44.630 --> 09:48.380
I don't care what happens to those siblings.

10:02.460 --> 10:03.530
<i>They're here.</i>

10:19.060 --> 10:21.230
This is just my luggage.

10:21.230 --> 10:22.650
I'm only carrying it through.

10:22.650 --> 10:24.280
Your toll?

10:25.050 --> 10:26.490
I don't have it on me.

10:26.490 --> 10:27.950
Breach of contract.

10:27.950 --> 10:29.070
No.

10:29.070 --> 10:32.180
We're just passing through 
with some luggage.

10:32.180 --> 10:35.370
I promise I'll bring meat the next 
time, if that's what you need.

10:35.800 --> 10:38.320
Abide by the contract and let us through.

10:44.650 --> 10:47.650
Odd Arm... This doesn't involve you.

10:47.650 --> 10:48.800
Give her to me!

10:49.900 --> 10:51.040
No.

10:51.720 --> 10:52.790
Missing.

10:52.790 --> 10:53.710
Incorrect.

10:53.710 --> 10:55.330
Not in the contract.

10:55.330 --> 10:56.030
I smell it.

10:56.030 --> 10:57.130
Not in the contract.

10:57.440 --> 10:59.420
If it's not in the contract...

11:00.080 --> 11:01.750
It's prey!

11:11.720 --> 11:12.910
Meat!

11:12.910 --> 11:14.740
Fresh meat!

11:14.740 --> 11:17.020
Meat! Meat!

11:17.460 --> 11:19.650
Get off my mate!

11:19.650 --> 11:20.850
Wolves?

11:34.180 --> 11:35.050
No!

11:35.050 --> 11:36.940
My mate!

11:36.940 --> 11:38.020
No!

11:38.470 --> 11:39.920
I must go.

11:39.920 --> 11:41.060
I must help!

11:41.470 --> 11:44.520
I must go to help!

11:46.960 --> 11:49.480
Our child!

11:54.470 --> 11:55.720
Stop!

11:57.980 --> 12:00.980
I'll pay for their passage.

12:00.980 --> 12:02.520
Just this once.

12:02.520 --> 12:04.520
Please, spare us.

12:06.330 --> 12:07.710
I want human.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.510
I can't do that.

12:10.510 --> 12:14.300
I can probably prepare a sheep or cow.

12:14.820 --> 12:16.710
Sheep or hound.

12:16.710 --> 12:19.790
As many as there are people 
not in the contract.

12:21.860 --> 12:22.750
All right.

12:23.030 --> 12:24.840
I'll bring them as soon as they're ready.

13:24.110 --> 13:25.560
Are you all right?

13:25.560 --> 13:26.940
Yeah, I'll live.

13:26.940 --> 13:28.370
Moron.

13:28.370 --> 13:30.310
You can't even use sorcery.

13:30.310 --> 13:31.250
Why...

13:36.850 --> 13:39.950
I'm glad you aren't hurt.

13:44.820 --> 13:45.790
You!

13:46.210 --> 13:48.590
You're safe? You dumbass!

13:48.590 --> 13:51.080
Oh, you're alive?

13:51.080 --> 13:52.050
Marielle-san.

13:53.220 --> 13:56.320
I appreciate that you 
and I are both scrappy.

13:56.320 --> 13:57.750
Thanks a lot.

13:57.750 --> 14:01.210
This nickel-and-dimer 
completely ripped me off.

14:01.210 --> 14:02.100
Oh?

14:02.100 --> 14:03.790
I saved you.

14:03.790 --> 14:06.520
Of course I'm taking compensation.

14:06.520 --> 14:07.440
Marielle.

14:08.150 --> 14:09.640
I'm glad to see you here.

14:10.310 --> 14:12.690
There's something I want you to investigate.

14:12.690 --> 14:13.600
Huh?

14:18.180 --> 14:19.270
Here.

14:19.610 --> 14:21.190
Thank you.

14:26.440 --> 14:34.530
Seth-san, is what happened today 
somehow related to your family?

14:38.550 --> 14:40.260
We're a family of sorcerers.

14:40.260 --> 14:42.000
It happens.

14:45.070 --> 14:46.850
Brother!

14:49.080 --> 14:50.940
Are you really leaving home?!

14:52.590 --> 14:53.980
Lucy.

14:53.980 --> 14:55.420
There's nothing I can do.

14:55.420 --> 14:56.660
Why...

14:57.650 --> 14:58.670
Seth.

14:59.030 --> 15:01.030
Are you done packing?

15:01.030 --> 15:06.050
I'll remind you never to mention 
that you're related to us.

15:06.420 --> 15:11.200
It'll hurt our reputation if people find out
 that I have a son who can't use sorcery

15:11.200 --> 15:13.550
and can't use the spiders.

15:16.130 --> 15:17.310
Damn it...

15:18.250 --> 15:23.700
We're lucky we had Lucy to 
make up for your uselessness.

15:27.180 --> 15:29.670
Is that true?

15:29.670 --> 15:31.350
It's my fault?

15:31.350 --> 15:33.870
Because I'm the successor?

15:52.510 --> 15:54.930
She's been shut in for a week now.

15:54.930 --> 15:56.970
She'll snap out of it soon enough.

15:58.460 --> 15:59.580
<i>Brother...</i>

16:00.350 --> 16:04.400
<i>How do you see me?</i>

16:12.350 --> 16:14.120
The spiders' call!

16:31.240 --> 16:32.550
A child?

16:45.440 --> 16:47.020
<i>They kick me out...</i>

16:47.580 --> 16:50.860
<i>And now they order me to talk 
sense into my sister before I leave?</i>

17:04.040 --> 17:06.750
So that's what I saw...

17:07.150 --> 17:11.710
Rival researchers, study results 
they want to steal, silencing...

17:11.710 --> 17:14.480
There are a lot of reasons 
people like us are attacked.

17:14.480 --> 17:20.850
In our case, it's still unclear 
what the motivation was.

17:22.040 --> 17:26.140
It's a mystery why Lucy was spared.

17:26.950 --> 17:28.940
The only thing we know

17:28.940 --> 17:33.990
is that every single spider we needed 
for binding and printing was stolen.

17:36.190 --> 17:43.180
Later, rumors spread that I'd hired
 hitmen to take out my family.

17:43.920 --> 17:44.900
What's the truth?

17:44.900 --> 17:50.770
If I'd really done that, I would
 have taken Lucy with me.

17:51.660 --> 17:56.420
Sadly, she distrusts me.

17:56.420 --> 17:57.520
She does?

17:58.180 --> 18:01.390
She suspects I despised her for
 inheriting the business in my stead.

18:01.390 --> 18:06.090
That I had those wolves attack our family.

18:06.090 --> 18:10.840
You never denied it or 
looked for the attackers?

18:11.280 --> 18:18.080
It was way too risky for a young man 
with no weapons and no backing.

18:18.470 --> 18:20.580
Though, thanks to that,

18:20.580 --> 18:26.090
I've found a job I'm good at, and I can 
pay for her to attend the College.

18:34.370 --> 18:37.980
Something is continuing 
to sap his magic power.

18:37.980 --> 18:38.990
Even now.

18:38.990 --> 18:40.030
Even now?

18:40.470 --> 18:42.690
I don't know where from, though.

18:43.000 --> 18:44.440
What else?

18:45.120 --> 18:49.390
There are two others in the College who 
have collapsed with the same symptoms.

18:49.910 --> 18:54.430
Are you aware of any such illness or curse?

18:54.430 --> 18:57.100
What's my reward for giving you an answer?

18:57.100 --> 18:59.660
I'm sure the College will prepare something.

19:02.050 --> 19:03.730
You owe me one.

19:07.010 --> 19:12.880
Goddess of glimmering lands, 
serpent-slaying god of storms...

19:12.880 --> 19:19.720
Please lend me your hand, 
your eyes, for a mere blink.

19:36.140 --> 19:37.130
Marielle.

19:38.060 --> 19:40.500
Could I have some water?

19:40.500 --> 19:42.360
I-I'll get some.

19:46.970 --> 19:49.150
The same scene I saw last time.

19:50.870 --> 19:54.980
I tried to help Phyllis a long time ago.

19:56.030 --> 19:58.910
And I read the book.

20:01.920 --> 20:05.640
I could barely even hold onto my own sanity.

20:06.140 --> 20:10.640
The book that I thought you could handle.

20:11.420 --> 20:12.630
Don't tell me...

20:14.700 --> 20:16.640
<i>The Testament of Carnamagos</i>.

20:17.120 --> 20:21.230
Someone's using that book to 
steal people's magic power.

20:21.230 --> 20:23.570
They're plotting something.

20:26.440 --> 20:28.000
Which means...

20:29.290 --> 20:30.630
The other one, too.

20:41.520 --> 20:44.800
Why did you help us?

20:45.740 --> 20:49.270
I wasn't going to just turn a blind eye.

20:50.900 --> 20:53.550
You saved that wolf, too.

20:53.550 --> 20:54.620
Why?

20:55.730 --> 21:00.680
You meant to have the hounds 
attack them, didn't you?

21:02.060 --> 21:06.470
They seemed to have a child.

21:06.470 --> 21:07.400
So...

21:08.860 --> 21:12.670
They were the ones who tried to 
kill us, the ones you just saved!

21:12.670 --> 21:13.880
They...

21:15.480 --> 21:18.410
They killed my entire family.

21:24.240 --> 21:28.350
I guess I need to think things over more.

21:29.660 --> 21:31.820
You don't think at all, do you?

21:34.200 --> 21:41.630
But thanks to you, I might be able to 
find out who attacked us, and why.

21:42.230 --> 21:44.900
So for that, I owe you.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.450
Lucy!

21:56.310 --> 21:57.400
Lucy!

21:57.790 --> 21:59.050
Lucy!

21:59.050 --> 22:00.160
Lucy?

22:00.160 --> 22:01.490
Lucy!

22:01.490 --> 22:02.390
Lucy!

22:07.230 --> 22:08.180
Yes.

22:08.180 --> 22:09.630
Understood.

22:10.340 --> 22:12.000
Please do.

22:17.840 --> 22:20.740
We have a pest.

22:20.740 --> 22:23.520
That's all the fun I can 
afford to let her have.
